          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peka lo arai lokookeng a Remalia, apot ka ngitunga ngitomwon-kan lu aponito alo Gilead totuko akiar Pekaya. Taara kesi Pekaya animaniyat ani eyei tooma akai a ekapolon, alo Samaria. Kilunyokin Peka nados a Pekaya toliwor ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.25"
            ]
