          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totoan Yosam sodi tonukakinae nalielin a ngikapolok na eyakasi lore a Daudi. Kilunyokin lokookeng Aas nados keng toliwor ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.38",
